IT GRC uses the unmodified intuitem CISO Assistant Community edition
(AGPL-3.0-or-later) as an external service over HTTP. This repository contains
no CISO Assistant source code, API schemas or library files. Framework libraries
are loaded into that service by URN. IT GRC is not affiliated with or endorsed by
intuitem.

Public HHS pages and the NIST SP 800-66 rev2 framework are referenced by URL or
URN; the repository does not distribute a copy of the regulation or the
framework. Python, Lima, k3s, Helm, Caddy and the sibling security-lab projects
keep their respective upstream terms. No container images or binaries are
included.

The lab report fixture and all CISO Assistant objects created by the bridge hold
synthetic data only. No private third-party materials or real patient records
are included.
